"""Final descriptive synthesis from existing aggregate/paired records only."""
import json,csv
import numpy as np
from .data import ROOT,P

def main():
 summary=json.loads((P/'summary.json').read_text());M=summary['metrics']['test'];E=json.loads((P/'execution.json').read_text());D=json.loads((P/'DCC_REPORT.json').read_text());I=json.loads((P/'interpretation.json').read_text());V=json.loads((P/'OUTPUT_VALIDATION.json').read_text());assert V['passed']
 warmup=json.loads((P/'WARMUP.json').read_text())
 A=json.loads((ROOT/'results/experimental_trajectory_evaluation_float64_v1/summary.json').read_text())
 portfolio=list(csv.DictReader((P/'portfolio_scores.csv').open()));checkpoints=list(csv.DictReader((P/'checkpoint_summary.csv').open()))
 arff=np.array([M[f'arff_s{i}']['nll'] for i in range(3)]);nn=np.array([M[f'neural_s{i}']['nll'] for i in range(3)])
 failure=[x for x in D['optimizer_records'] if not x['valid']]
 lines=['','## Final findings and bounded completion','','1. **Colloidal correction:** all eight float64 eigen/Cholesky comparisons pass the original rtol=atol=1e-10. The neural mean NLL changed by about1.05e-8; other changes are at double-precision rounding scale. No conclusion or coverage ranking changed. The old failed checks remain preserved. The four-versus-six-column schema and experimental-cell/optical-phase limitations remain unresolved; retain it as an archived supplementary candidate, without automatic manuscript inclusion.','',f'2. **Financial execution and validation:** nine ARFF and nine neural fits completed, with a valid DCC comparator. All147 archive hashes,19 serialized stage envelopes,18 earliest-minimum histories, pre-test checkpoint reconstruction, configuration selection, causal timestamps, common Gaussian algebra and output consistency passed. Fitting17349 targets; validation8784; test8760. DCC had {len(failure)} unsuccessful start(s) among12 bounded marginal/correlation optimizer starts; every objective had a valid converged candidate, chosen by fitting objective. No fit was rerun, replaced or discarded for poor performance. The initial incomplete-hour acquisition failure is preserved; incomplete bars were excluded before fitting, not interpolated.','',f'3. **Predictive value:** selected ARFF lambda=.064 test NLL mean {arff.mean():.6f}, sample SD {arff.std(ddof=1):.6f}, range[{arff.min():.6f},{arff.max():.6f}]. It is worse than all three domain baselines in each of12 test months for each of3 fitting seeds. There is no positive predictive result to promote. Selected neural LR=.001 mean {nn.mean():.6f}, sample SD {nn.std(ddof=1):.6f}, range[{nn.min():.6f},{nn.max():.6f}]; DCC {M["dcc"]["nll"]:.6f}, EWMA(.97) {M["ewma"]["nll"]:.6f}, constant {M["constant"]["nll"]:.6f}. Neural-versus-DCC results vary by seed; this pilot does not establish neural superiority. Seed SD describes fitting variation on one shared market history.','',f'4. **Off-diagonal/SPD findings:** retaining ARFF off-diagonals worsens NLL versus its own raw-diagonal ablation by {I["off_diagonal_full_minus_diagonal"]} nats per observation for seeds0,1,2. Test raw SPD violations are {[M[f"arff_s{i}"]["raw_spd_violation_rate"] for i in range(3)]}; the fixed floor therefore changes a substantial portion of forecasts. Diagonal-only forecasts also have raw negative entries and poor scores. Large covariance-weighted residuals after flooring show poor calibration under the declared rule; no alternate-floor analysis was run, so a quantitative causal attribution to the particular floor is not established. This does not justify choosing a new floor or ridge from test outcomes.','', '5. **Inclusion recommendation:** retain the financial pilot as an archival negative application diagnostic, with optional supplementary reporting if the paper discusses scope limits. It is not evidence of a successful real-data ARFF application and is not recommended as a new main-text application. No automatic manuscript update or further search is warranted by this bounded task. These findings concern this fixed basket, features, finite candidate budget and scoring rule; they are not a universal statement about ARFF or financial models.','','### Calibration and raw covariance detail','','Raw eigenvalues and projection magnitudes below are in fitting-scaled coordinates. Joint95% coverage is already reported above; the Gaussian nominal mean squared Mahalanobis value is3. Full symmetric-whitened means/second moments and50/90/95% coverage are retained for both splits in summary.json.','','| Forecast | Mean Mahalanobis squared | Min raw eigenvalue | Mean projection Frobenius | Max projection Frobenius |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
 for name,m in M.items():lines.append(f'| {name} | {m["mean_mahalanobis_squared"]:.6g} | {m["min_raw_eigenvalue"]:.6g} | {m["mean_projection_frobenius"]:.6g} | {m["max_projection_frobenius"]:.6g} |')
 lines+=['','### Fixed portfolio outcomes','','Scalar Gaussian scores use the same frozen physical forecasts; lower is better. Forecast variance, observed squared-return mean, standardized second moment and95% coverage are in portfolio_scores.csv, including all months.','','| Forecast | Equal-weight NLL | BTC−ETH spread NLL |','|---|---:|---:|']
 for name in M:
  rows=[r for r in portfolio if r['split']=='test' and r['method']==name and r['month']=='ALL'];by={r['portfolio']:float(r['scalar_nll']) for r in rows};lines.append(f'| {name} | {by["equal_weight"]:.6f} | {by["BTC_ETH_spread"]:.6f} |')
 lines+=['','The joint-score ablation does not imply that off-diagonal forecasts are uniformly useless: full ARFF forecasts score better than their diagonal-only versions for both fixed portfolios in all three seeds. Neither full ARFF portfolio beats the corresponding EWMA/DCC score. These are fixed descriptive projections of the same forecasts, not optimized portfolios or substitutes for the primary joint score.','','### Selection and execution record','','All nine ARFF runs selected native post-adaptation iteration1 (all300 iterations were still executed). Neural native epoch indices are zero-based; all300 epochs were executed. Selected-configuration neural indices by seed are '+str([r['selected_native_index'] for r in checkpoints if r['method']=='neural' and r['grid_index']=='1'])+'. Checkpoint_summary.csv retains native validation losses and elapsed cost for every candidate. ARFF has3072 retained parameters (1536 frequencies+1536 amplitudes); neural has1275. This is not a capacity-matched or equally optimized comparison.','',f'One A6000, GPU UUID {E["gpu_uuid"]}; allocated {E["allocated_seconds"]:.3f}s = {E["allocated_seconds"]/3600:.6f} GPU-hours, supervisor wall {E["supervisor_wall_seconds"]:.3f}s, sampled peak device memory {E["peak_device_memory_MiB"]:.0f}MiB (5-second samples, not an exact instantaneous maximum). Warm-up{warmup["seconds"]:.3f}s is included. Allocation conservatively includes CPU DCC and reporting time while the GPU was held. No recovery was used. The detached controller exited normally and launched no follow-up.','', 'The frozen pre-test sources were unchanged. The added output-audit and closing-report scripts only read completed archives/aggregates. Figures were visually inspected for readable labels and clipping. Verification is automated and is not an independent human scientific review. No production, data-generation or manuscript sources were changed.']
 report=P/'REPORT.md';original=report.read_text().split('\n## Final findings and bounded completion')[0];report.write_text(original+'\n'.join(lines)+'\n')
 text=f'''COMPLETE: both bounded tasks; no further work dispatched.
Colloidal: all8 original1e-10 algebra checks pass after common float64 reevaluation; neural NLL change~1.05e-8, conclusions unchanged; no new inference/fitting.
Financial:18/18candidate fits and valid DCC; final identity/causality/checkpoint/likelihood checks passed. Test8760 hourly targets in2025.
Selected by2024 only: ARFF lambda=.064; neural LR=.001; EWMA=.97. All3 fitting seeds retained.
Test NLL: constant{M['constant']['nll']:.6f}; EWMA{M['ewma']['nll']:.6f}; DCC{M['dcc']['nll']:.6f}; ARFF seeds{arff.tolist()}; neural seeds{nn.tolist()}.
ARFF loses to all3domain baselines in all12months for all3seeds. Off-diagonals worsen scores; raw SPD violations21.5–30.8%; fixed-floor score and calibration poor. No floor/parameter retuning.
DCC: {len(failure)} failed predetermined optimizer start(s) retained; other starts converged validly, comparator complete.
Resources:{E['allocated_seconds']/3600:.6f} allocatedGPU-hours;{E['supervisor_wall_seconds']:.3f}s wall; sampled peak{E['peak_device_memory_MiB']:.0f}MiB; zero recovery.
Recommendation: financial archival negative diagnostic, optional supplementary scope discussion; not a successful main-text ARFF application. Colloidal archived supplementary candidate with unresolved schema/cell/phase limitations.
All accepted results/manuscripts preserved. No test-based dataset/seed/configuration choice. Shared-market fitting seeds and descriptive months are not independent-market replications. Raw data/model files local, not publicly hosted.
'''
 (P/'FINAL_SUMMARY.txt').write_text(text);print(text)
if __name__=='__main__':main()
